:rPr lang="en-US" altLang="zh-CN" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/><a:ea typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/><a:cs typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/><a:sym typeface="+mn-ea"/></a:rPr><a:t>M</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" altLang="zh-CN" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/><a:ea typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/><a:cs typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/></a:rPr><a:t>CP </a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="zh-CN" altLang="en-US" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/><a:ea typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/><a:cs typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/></a:rPr><a:t>服务的核心对象是模型本身而非用户个体，它仅解决模型安全调用外部资源问题，而不关注模型代表特定用户进行可信交互的问题。</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr lvl="1"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="150000"/></a:lnSpc></a:pPr><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" altLang="zh-CN" b="1" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/><a:ea typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/><a:cs typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/></a:endParaRPr></a:p><a:p><a:pPr lvl="1"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="150000"/></a:lnSpc></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" altLang="zh-CN" b="1" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/><a:ea typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/><a:cs typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/></a:rPr><a:t>2. A2A</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="zh-CN" altLang="en-US" b="1" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/><a:ea typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/><a:cs typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/></a:rPr><a:t>（</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" altLang="zh-CN" b="1" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/><a:ea typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/><a:cs typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/></a:rPr><a:t>Agent-to-Agent Protocol</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="zh-CN" altLang="en-US" b="1" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/><a:ea typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/><a:cs typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/></a:rPr><a:t>）</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" altLang="zh-CN" b="1" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/><a:ea typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/><a:cs typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/></a:endParaRPr></a:p><a:p><a:pPr lvl="1" indent="457200"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="150000"/></a:lnSpc></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" altLang="zh-CN" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/><a:ea typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/><a:cs typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/><a:sym typeface="+mn-ea"/></a:rPr><a:t>A2A </a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="zh-CN" altLang="en-US" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/><a:ea typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/><a:cs typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/><a:sym typeface="+mn-ea"/></a:rPr><a:t>适用于企业内部的智能体通信，关注点集中于任务逻辑与工作流层</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" altLang="zh-CN" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/><a:ea typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/><a:cs typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/><a:sym typeface="+mn-ea"/></a:rPr><a:t>,</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="zh-CN" altLang="en-US" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/><a:ea typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/><a:cs typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/></a:rPr><a:t>并未建立独立的身份层。因此，</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" altLang="zh-CN" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/><a:ea typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/><a:cs typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/></a:rPr><a:t>A2A </a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="zh-CN" altLang="en-US" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/><a:ea typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/><a:cs typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/></a:rPr><a:t>与个人用户的关联度极低，它既不考虑自然人的身份表达，也不涉及个人数据或自我主权身份（</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" altLang="zh-CN" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/><a:ea typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/><a:cs typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/></a:rPr><a:t>SSI</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="zh-CN" altLang="en-US" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/><a:ea typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/><a:cs typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/></a:rPr><a:t>）的实现。</a:t></a:r></a:p><a:p><a:pPr lvl="1" indent="457200"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="150000"/></a:lnSpc></a:pPr><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" altLang="zh-CN" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/><a:ea typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/><a:cs typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/></a:endParaRPr></a:p><a:p><a:pPr lvl="1"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="150000"/></a:lnSpc></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" altLang="zh-CN" b="1" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/><a:ea typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/><a:cs typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/><a:sym typeface="+mn-ea"/></a:rPr><a:t>3. ANP</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="zh-CN" altLang="en-US" b="1" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/><a:ea typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/><a:cs typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/><a:sym typeface="+mn-ea"/></a:rPr><a:t>（</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" altLang="zh-CN" b="1" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/><a:ea typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/><a:cs typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/><a:sym typeface="+mn-ea"/></a:rPr><a:t>Agent Network Protocol</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="zh-CN" altLang="en-US" b="1" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/><a:ea typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/><a:cs typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/><a:sym typeface="+mn-ea"/></a:rPr><a:t>）</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="en-US" altLang="zh-CN" b="1" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/><a:ea typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/><a:cs typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/></a:endParaRPr></a:p><a:p><a:pPr lvl="1" indent="457200"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="150000"/></a:lnSpc></a:pPr><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" altLang="zh-CN" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/><a:ea typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/><a:cs typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/><a:sym typeface="+mn-ea"/></a:rPr><a:t>ANP </a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="zh-CN" altLang="en-US" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/><a:ea typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/><a:cs typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/><a:sym typeface="+mn-ea"/></a:rPr><a:t>提出要在去中心化的智能体网络中，实现每个智能体的点对点的通信。并且提倡每个个人用户可以拥有一个个人智能体，智能体可以自主生成</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" altLang="zh-CN" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/><a:ea typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/><a:cs typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/><a:sym typeface="+mn-ea"/></a:rPr><a:t>DID</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="zh-CN" altLang="en-US" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/><a:ea typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/><a:cs typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/><a:sym typeface="+mn-ea"/></a:rPr><a:t>与</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" altLang="zh-CN" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/><a:ea typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/><a:cs typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/><a:sym typeface="+mn-ea"/></a:rPr><a:t>did</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="zh-CN" altLang="en-US" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/><a:ea typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/><a:cs typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/><a:sym typeface="+mn-ea"/></a:rPr><a:t>公私钥对，从而实现身份验证和信任建立；但</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" altLang="zh-CN" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/><a:ea typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/><a:cs typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/><a:sym typeface="+mn-ea"/></a:rPr><a:t>DID </a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="zh-CN" altLang="en-US" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/><a:ea typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/><a:cs typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/><a:sym typeface="+mn-ea"/></a:rPr><a:t>仅代表智能体自身的身份，并未建立自然人与智能体的可验证绑定。</a:t></a:r><a:endParaRPr lang="zh-CN" altLang="en-US" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/><a:ea typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/><a:cs typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/></a:endParaRPr></a:p><a:p><a:pPr lvl="1"><a:lnSpc><a:spcPct val="150000"/></a:lnSpc></a:pPr><a:endParaRPr lang="zh-CN" altLang="en-US" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/><a:ea typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/><a:cs typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/></a:endParaRPr></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp><p:sp><p:nvSpPr><p:cNvPr id="11" name="文本框 10"/><p:cNvSpPr txBox="1"/><p:nvPr/></p:nvSpPr><p:spPr><a:xfrm><a:off x="2461260" y="60325"/><a:ext cx="9333230" cy="460375"/></a:xfrm><a:prstGeom prst="rect"><a:avLst/></a:prstGeom><a:noFill/></p:spPr><p:txBody><a:bodyPr wrap="square" rtlCol="0"><a:spAutoFit/></a:bodyPr><a:lstStyle/><a:p><a:r><a:rPr lang="en-US" altLang="zh-CN" sz="2400" b="1" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/><a:ea typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/></a:rPr><a:t>ANP,A2A,MCP</a:t></a:r><a:r><a:rPr lang="zh-CN" altLang="en-US" sz="2400" b="1" dirty="0"><a:latin typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/><a:ea typeface="微软雅黑" panose="020B0503020204020204" charset="-122"/></a:rPr><a:t>的身份构建分析</a:t></a:r></a:p></p:txBody></p:sp></p:spTree></p:cSld><p:clrMapOvr><a:masterClrMapping/></p:clrMapOvr></p:sld>